ga5j(){return"The VIP tier is built to the highest standards of quality and finish. It uses top-grade materials, refined finishes and modern systems throughout. Ideal for clients who want the best without weighing the cost. Includes first-class thermal and waterproof insulation plus advanced electrical and plumbing systems. Quality that lasts for generations with little maintenance. A long-term investment in your comfort and safety \u2014 the cost is higher, but the value is hard to put a price on."},
ga5h(){return"The premium tier balances high quality with a sensible price. It uses very good materials with elegant, practical finishes. An excellent fit for families who want a high-quality home on a mid-range budget. Includes solid thermal insulation and reliable electrical and plumbing systems. The sweet spot between cost and quality \u2014 a smart investment that delivers comfort and safety for many years. Our most popular choice."},
ga5g(){return"The standard tier delivers good quality at a fair price. It uses reliable standard materials that meet every safety code. Suited to mid-range budgets and everyday projects. Includes basic insulation and conventional electrical and plumbing systems. A practical, economical choice for families that gives you a safe, comfortable home at a reasonable cost \u2014 the best option if you are looking for balance."},
ga5i(){return"The economy tier focuses on saving cost while keeping the essentials. It uses basic materials that meet the minimum building standards. Suited to limited budgets and simpler projects, it provides core protection and safety at the lowest possible cost. A good starting point you can upgrade later, and a way to own a home on a tight budget. The priority is safe construction at minimum cost."},
