gaaj(){return"What is the 3D tour, and is it free?"},
gaai(){return"A virtual walk through the house before you buy its plan. It's free and needs no account: on the page of a plan that has a tour, tap \u201cFree 3D tour\u201d."},
gaa4(){return"What does the package include?"},
gaa2(){return"The package usually includes these drawings:"},
gaa3(){return"Each plan's page lists exactly what its package includes."},
gaa8(){return"How do I pay for a package?"},
gaa5(){return"On the plan's page tap \u201cBuy the package\u201d. Under the payment methods \u201cWhatsApp: SuperKi or transfer\u201d is chosen, so tap \u201cPay\u201d with the amount: you send your request on WhatsApp, we send you the SuperKi or transfer details, and we activate the package once it's confirmed."},
gaa7(){return"You can also choose \u201cCard\u201d (Qi Card, Visa, Mastercard) under the payment methods, then tap \u201cPay\u201d; the package is activated once the payment is confirmed."},
gaa6(){return"\u201cCard\u201d is listed under the payment methods, but paying by card isn't available yet."},
ga9N(){return"Where do I find my drawings after buying?"},
ga9M(){return"In \u201cAccount\u201d \u2192 \u201cMy purchases\u201d once the package is activated, signed in with the number you bought with. Open the plan and tap any item under \u201cWhat the package includes\u201d. If an item's file isn't uploaded yet, its page says \u201cComing soon\u201d."},
gaaa(){return"What does \u201cAwaiting activation\u201d mean?"},
gaa9(){return"That you sent the payment request from this phone and our team hasn't activated the package yet: they activate it once the payment is confirmed. To ask about it, tap \u201cFollow up on WhatsApp\u201d on the plan's page."},
gaae(){return"Can I get a refund after buying?"},
gaad(){return"No. A package reaches you when we activate it on your account, and its sale is final: its price isn't refunded after purchase, so review the plan's page and what the package includes before you pay. If a file in it is missing, won't open or doesn't match the plan you bought, contact us and we'll supply or correct it free of charge. Money you paid twice, paid above the package's price, or that reached us for a package we couldn't activate, we return to you."},
gaac(){return"How do I ask for a quote to build my house?"},
gaab(){return"In \u201cBuild\u201d, choose how to build and tap \u201cRequest a quote\u201d, fill in your plot's details and your phone number, then tap \u201cSend on WhatsApp\u201d: WhatsApp opens with your request, and it reaches us once you send it from there. You don't need an account."},
gaa1(){return"How do I order building materials?"},
gaa_(){return"Choose your city and add the materials to your cart, then tap \u201cConfirm order\u201d (you'll need to sign in with your number). There's no payment in the app: our purchasing team calls you to confirm the order and delivery."},
gaa0(){return"Ordering in the app is paused for now, and the market's prices are for reference."},
ga9L(){return"Where do you deliver?"},
ga9J(){return"To the cities listed under \u201cAvailable for delivery now\u201d in the city list. Choose your city at the top of the market; if delivery doesn't reach it yet, its prices are for reference."},
ga9K(){return"Delivery doesn't reach any city right now, so the market's prices are for reference only."},
gaah(){return"How do I sign in?"},
gaag(){return"With your phone number and a code sent to you on WhatsApp, no password. If the code doesn't arrive, check that WhatsApp works on that number, then tap \u201cResend\u201d."},
ga9X(){return"How do I change my name?"},
ga9W(){return"In \u201cAccount\u201d, tap \u201cEdit\u201d on your card, then type the new name and save it."},
ga9V(){return"How do I change the app's language?"},
ga9U(){return"In \u201cAccount\u201d \u2192 \u201cLanguage\u201d: Arabic, Kurdish or English."},
ga9I(){return"How do I delete my account?"},
ga9H(){return"In \u201cAccount\u201d, open \u201cPrivacy\u201d, then tap \u201cDelete account\u201d and confirm. An account can't be deleted while it has a store order our team confirmed that hasn't been delivered yet."},
ga9G(){return"What data do you collect?"},
ga9F(){return"We ask for your phone number, name and where you live to create your account, and keep what you buy and order in the app; we log sign-in attempts to protect accounts, and receive crash reports to fix the app. We don't access your device's location, contacts or photos, and we don't sell your data."},
